1012
02:06:56.906 --> 02:06:59.906
I haven't said anything with that.

1013
02:06:59.906 --> 02:07:04.906
So if you think you're very smart, then I'm just as smart as you are.

1014
02:07:04.906 --> 02:07:07.906
So most people are just as smart as I am.

1015
02:07:09.906 --> 02:07:11.906
