1029
02:07:49.906 --> 02:07:51.906
But we have a reason for that.

1030
02:07:51.906 --> 02:07:52.906
I mean it.

1031
02:07:52.906 --> 02:07:54.906
We have a reason for that.

1032
02:07:54.906 --> 02:07:59.906
Everything, I try, I hope I have explained it well.

