1050
02:08:52.906 --> 02:08:54.906
We have said that, right?

1051
02:08:54.906 --> 02:08:56.906
Lastly...

1052
02:08:56.906 --> 02:08:59.906
Sorry, sorry, I'm just still busy, but quickly.

1053
