1057
02:09:16.906 --> 02:09:17.906
And this concerns all people.

1058
02:09:17.906 --> 02:09:21.906
Raise your hand if you are doing something in any team.

1059
02:09:21.906 --> 02:09:22.906
In any team at all.

1060
02:09:22.906 --> 02:09:23.906
In any team at all.

1061
02:09:23.906 --> 02:09:25.906
If you help out as volunteers.

1062
02:09:25.906 --> 02:09:27.906
Volunteering in an open church.

1063
02:09:27.906 --> 02:09:29.906
Good job.

1064
02:09:29.906 --> 02:09:31.906
That's not much and I'm actually glad about that.

1065
02:09:31.906 --> 02:09:32.906
That's good.

1066
02:09:32.906 --> 02:09:34.906
That's actually quite good.

1067
02:09:34.906 --> 02:09:39.906
I said this weekend to all the leaders...

1068
02:09:39.906 --> 02:09:42.906
