And that's all fine, because so far they have all been testimonies or questions about this or that.

1074
02:10:16.906 --> 02:10:20.906
Starting today, I will no longer respond to that.

1075
02:10:20.906 --> 02:10:23.906
And that's not because I have no interest in you.

