Because it often goes wrong these days.

1091
02:11:24.906 --> 02:11:31.906
In the last ten years, Vanessa and I have literally cried over situations where we see churches falling.

1092
02:11:31.906 --> 02:11:33.906
Because of uncleanness.

1093
02:11:33.906 --> 02:11:35.906
Because of adultery.

1094
02:11:35.906 --> 02:11:37.906
Because of idolatry.

1095
