Not just saying, oh you did that so well. Do you know how much I appreciate you?

1116
02:13:36.906 --> 02:13:39.906
You know that kind of talk? We are not going to do that.

1117
02:13:39.906 --> 02:13:41.906
Take it easy.

1118
