1122
02:13:57.906 --> 02:14:02.906
The teaching and the gifts of the Holy Spirit must be strictly guarded.

1123
02:14:02.906 --> 02:14:13.906
We are an evangelical church. I believe that the Holy Spirit was poured out in Acts 2 over the congregation of Jesus Christ.

1124
02:14:13.906 --> 02:14:17.906
I believe in speaking in tongues.

1125
02:14:17.906 --> 02:14:24.906
