Speaking in tongues is from the Holy Spirit, is good. We should especially do it.

1130
02:14:39.906 --> 02:14:45.906
Prophesying is one of the gifts of the Holy Spirit, is good. We should especially do it.

1131
02:14:45.906 --> 02:14:52.906
If someone is set free by the Holy Spirit in the power of the blood of Jesus in the Holy Spirit...

1132
