1144
02:15:55.906 --> 02:15:58.906
And I pay attention to that. I am a shepherd for this church.

1145
02:15:58.906 --> 02:16:04.906
And if I see that things are going wrong in those Holy Spirit works, we need to intervene.

1146
02:16:04.906 --> 02:16:08.906
We must say, this is not good. This is not what the Bible says.

1147
02:16:08.906 --> 02:16:11.906
Yes, with the Holy Spirit, woohoo.

1148
02:16:11.906 --> 02:16:16.906
