That said, I will give you an example and I want to share this.

1150
02:16:22.906 --> 02:16:31.906
Many people in Open Church have a book at home by a so-called prophet named Sean Boltz.

1151
02:16:31.906 --> 02:16:40.906
I never do this. I never mention the names of other preachers or pastors from churches from this podium.

1152
02:16:40.906 --> 02:16:47.906
You won't catch me doing that easily. But when I need to pull a wolf from the flock,

1153
02:16:47.906 --> 02:16:51.906
then it is our responsibility to do so. That is all the Bible says.

1154
02:16:51.906 --> 02:16:59.906
Sean Boltz is one of the people who has gone around the world and has spoken prophecies.

1155
02:16:59.906 --> 02:17:06.906
He presented himself as a prophet. But it has come to light that this Sean Boltz is a wolf.

1156
02:17:06.906 --> 02:17:15.906
An absolute false prophet who has taken his prophecies from the Word for twenty years,

1157
02:17:15.906 --> 02:17:21.906
you have never heard of the Word, a bizarre word, called datamining.

1158
02:17:21.906 --> 02:17:27.906
Datamining is when you go to someone's Facebook page to see who someone is

1159
02:17:27.906 --> 02:17:33.906
