1160
02:17:33.906 --> 02:17:40.906
This man has done that for twenty years. He has been exposed by reliable men of God.

1161
02:17:40.906 --> 02:17:46.906
And because we have also dealt with people in open church there,

1162
02:17:46.906 --> 02:17:53.906
there are victims that have fallen because of this false ministry, we need to set that right.

1163
02:17:53.906 --> 02:18:00.906
And Vanessa and I and Bram and Hels, the elders of open church, we have talked about this.

1164
02:18:00.906 --> 02:18:04.906
All books by Sean Boltz are off the shelves of the bookstore.

1165
02:18:04.906 --> 02:18:10.906
We want nothing more to do with it, because a wolf is a wolf and a wolf must be cast out by the flock.

1166
02:18:10.906 --> 02:18:13.906
He must be urgently cast out by the flock.

1167
02:18:13.906 --> 02:18:20.906
Is there a grace path for this man? Can he come to healing? Yes, if he comes to repentance.

1168
02:18:20.906 --> 02:18:24.906
As long as he does not come to repentance, he will be condemned.

1169
02:18:24.906 --> 02:18:29.906
But if he says to himself, I'm sorry Lord, forgive me, I am a sinner, that's fine.

1170
02:18:29.906 --> 02:18:34.906
He can never again, he can never again stand in the ministry. Never again.

1171
02:18:34.906 --> 02:18:39.906
This is what the Bible says, someone who is in the ministry must lead a pure and holy life.

1172
02:18:39.906 --> 02:18:46.906
Sean Boltz is gone. So if you have anything about Sean Boltz in your house, just remove it.

1173
02:18:46.906 --> 02:18:55.906
I pray for this man that he comes to repentance, because to this day he still admits nothing, despite irrefutable evidence.

1174
02:18:55.906 --> 02:19:00.906
And here is something else, what I just said, men take care of men, women take care of women.

1175
02:19:00.906 --> 02:19:06.906
Sean Boltz is not only guilty of false prophecy, but there are also many sexual allegations against this man.

1176
02:19:06.906 --> 02:19:13.906
And this is what we always see together, when there is disorder, there is always uncleanness.

1177
02:19:13.906 --> 02:19:18.906
Always. When there is disorder, there is always uncleanness.

1178
02:19:18.906 --> 02:19:24.906
Therefore, the church must remain pure, holy, and safe, in Jesus' name. Amen.

1179
02:19:27.906 --> 02:19:29.906
Shall we stand, please?

1180
02:19:30.906 --> 02:19:35.906
Okay, sorry, quarter to one, but the church is safe, so...

1181
