1185
02:19:58.906 --> 02:20:03.906
We acknowledge you as the good shepherd, take care of open church.

1186
02:20:03.906 --> 02:20:08.906
Lord, I declare the blood of Jesus over open church.

1187
02:20:08.906 --> 02:20:14.906
That no weapon formed against open church shall prosper in Jesus' mighty name.

1188
02:20:14.906 --> 02:20:20.906
Lord, I want to ask you to send your holy angels to the building, to the people,

1189
02:20:20.906 --> 02:20:23.906
to the lives of the people, to the families, to the homes of the people,

1190
02:20:23.906 --> 02:20:29.906
so that we may walk in Christ, in the safety of King Jesus.

1191
02:20:29.906 --> 02:20:33.906
Lord, help us to be one, to keep our conscience pure,

1192
02:20:33.906 --> 02:20:41.906
and help us, correct us if we take steps that turn out to come with false philosophy or false prophecies.

1193
02:20:41.906 --> 02:20:47.906
I thank you for holy men who may be watchtowers in the church of Jesus Christ.

1194
02:20:47.906 --> 02:20:51.906
Lord, I really want to pronounce a blessing over everyone in this room.

1195
02:20:51.906 --> 02:20:54.906
Lord, that our souls may be guarded.

1196
02:20:54.906 --> 02:20:59.906
Lord, that we may look to Jesus and that we may stand before Jesus at the throne,

1197
02:20:59.906 --> 02:21:04.906
